  "contentHtml": "<p>진도&#160;때문에&#160;구상하다가&#160;미뤄둔&#160;미완성의&#160;활동입니다.</p><p>3단원 생물의 분류 진도 나가고 공룡뼈를 나름 맞춰보고 분류하기해볼려고 하다가 말았는데요. ^^;;&#160;</p><p>어디서 받은 공룡뼈 사진은 익룡의 뼈입니다.&#160;</p><p>도화지에 뼈맞춰붙이고 살도 나름 붙여보고 공룡이름도 지어보라 할려고했는데...</p><p>부끄럽지만 혹 도움이 되실까 올려봅니다</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fa826889040e7f84ffa356a9606b8494f901d74b?download\" data-file-name=\"공룡뼈 맞추기.pptx\" data-file-size=\"3290212\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHw%26dataid%3D127%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20210914102729&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Ffa826889040e7f84ffa356a9606b8494f901d74b')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">공룡뼈 맞추기</span><span class=\"type\">.pptx</span></div><div class=\"size\">3.14MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/53c075036b4e9619a3aeea8fc0a51cec77419f46?download\" data-file-name=\"공룡뼈.hwp\" data-file-size=\"1320448\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHw%26dataid%3D127%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20210914102729&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F53c075036b4e9619a3aeea8fc0a51cec77419f46')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">공룡뼈</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.26MB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
